== Points of Interest ==
=== Fury Cutter Move Tutor ===
In the Gate leading to [[Viridian Forest]], a female Bug Catcher teaches the move [[bulbapedia:Fury Cutter (move)|Fury Cutter]] for {{P$}}200.

=== Bug Bite Move Tutor ===
In the Gate leading to [[Route 2 (After the Forest)]], a male Bug Catcher teaches the move [[bulbapedia:Bug Bite (move)|Bug Bite]] for {{P$}}2,000.

